      "message": "Hmm.. I don\u0027t understand this part.  The API shouldn\u0027t require the service to provide the CID to the client.  Instead, it should probably just a ping to let virtualization service call back with the CID it already knows.  I see a TODO in the AIDL.\n\n    /**\n     * Notifies that the payload is ready to serve.\n     * TODO(b/191845268): remove cid parameter\n     */\n    void notifyPayloadReady(int cid);\n\nIs the TODO(b/199259751) references below accurate?  The bug seems to be asking for the clients\u0027 CID, not to provide the clients CID.",
